{"steam_appid":4324480,"steam_name":"Dirty Business","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4324480/547787332/ee89317ee4f08522f2466e0f3ddd94d0d3651359/1784587427/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785492300","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257335740/06220a4d393d7e57dab9782f45a056bbad8aed83/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785492300","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/23910d837a7147831a56fc9cd8b77d9ffe8efc7f/ss_23910d837a7147831a56fc9cd8b77d9ffe8efc7f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785492302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/d12a4201d29205580d249830b96d7a7206b92991/ss_d12a4201d29205580d249830b96d7a7206b92991.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785492302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/1698a80f1074a854701383b24c0a963d85dc633d/ss_1698a80f1074a854701383b24c0a963d85dc633d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785492302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/dd3a0358a941fa809939336173027ddca2c5bd4e/ss_dd3a0358a941fa809939336173027ddca2c5bd4e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785492302","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/806c2d7b693a68410e6c1deab403e92eaf06fe44/ss_806c2d7b693a68410e6c1deab403e92eaf06fe44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785492302"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand an underground criminal operation beneath the city. Produce drugs, weapons, counterfeit money, and other illegal activities. Hire workers, grow your gang, optimize production, operate secret cartel airstrip and expand into city-wide distribution. Take control of districts and build your empire from the shadows in single-player or co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Illegal Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce multiple drugs, counterfeit different currencies, and manufacture various weapons. Complete customer orders or sell them directly for maximum profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Control Distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send small and medium orders to the surface via elevator, and use front company vehicles for larger shipments.<br>Dispatch massive orders from your <strong>secret cartel airstrip</strong> to distant parts of the city and across the country.<br>Handle distribution yourself or hire street dealers to move products across the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers to grow plants, produce chemical drugs, and manufacture weapons, then hire street dealers to handle drug sales across the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade Your Underground Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and upgrade your underground base over time, unlock side production rooms, and open an underground garage to support a large-scale distribution fleet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 friends in co-op to build and grow your criminal empire together.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or Similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required for Online CO-OP</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.3GHz 4-Core/6-Core or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required for Online CO-OP</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Plan Dirty Games"],"publishers":["Plan Dirty Games"],"release_date":"22 Jul, 2026"}